00:29:59.947 --> 00:30:02.568
[Sound of Soobin and Sujeong’s conversation]

528
00:30:04.605 --> 00:30:05.718
Who is that guy again...

529
00:30:07.054 --> 00:30:07.987
[sigh]

530
00:30:08.456 --> 00:30:09.523
(Juyeon) Stop!

531
00:30:09.590 --> 00:30:10.991
[Interesting music]
Until there

532
00:30:11.058 --> 00:30:12.491
[Humorous sound effects]
[Sound of door opening]

533
00:30:13.728 --> 00:30:15.500
(Wonseop) Huh? Director
[Sound effect of glancing]

534
00:30:15.567 --> 00:30:16.762
Ah, why is the general manager here?

535
00:30:17.965 --> 00:30:19.131
[Embarrassed sound effect]
Father?

536
00:30:21.903 --> 00:30:23.169
(Hajin) Soobin’s girlfriend?

537
00:30:23.771 --> 00:30:25.266
Didn’t you say you saw it last time?

538
00:30:25.333 --> 00:30:28.533
Yeah, I decided to take another look at lunch tomorrow.

539
00:30:28.600 --> 00:30:29.834
Just because I buy food

540
00:30:29.901 --> 00:30:31.445
(Hajin) Buying food? where?

541
00:30:31.512 --> 00:30:33.333
(Surrender) Do you know White Dragon Pavilion?

542
00:30:33.400 --> 00:30:34.900
I heard you made a reservation there?

543
00:30:34.967 --> 00:30:36.733
Oh, that's a good restaurant over there.

544
00:30:36.800 --> 00:30:39.366
But I'm not a husband
Buying food for your boyfriend’s family?

545
00:30:39.433 --> 00:30:42.500
So, it's the utmost sincerity, right?

546
00:30:42.567 --> 00:30:44.290
(Edited) I'll just do the calculations

547
00:30:44.792 --> 00:30:45.759
(Soobin) Ah!
[Interesting Music - Continued]

548
00:30:45.826 --> 00:30:48.333
This person paid my dad’s hospital bills.

549
00:30:48.400 --> 00:30:49.966
Oh, that general manager?

550
00:30:50.033 --> 00:30:51.063
ah!
[Soobin clears his throat]

551
00:30:51.130 --> 00:30:51.999
Hello?

552
00:30:52.066 --> 00:30:54.684
Ah, this is Baek Soobin, the eldest son of this family.

553
00:30:54.751 --> 00:30:57.436
(Wonseop) No, but the director
Well, what's going on here?

554
00:30:57.967 --> 00:30:58.837
(Juyeon) Ah!

555
00:30:59.400 --> 00:31:03.673
I also came here because I had an appointment.
We met just like this

556
00:31:03.740 --> 00:31:06.180
(Wonseop) Oh, that's right, yeah
Then hurry, hurry and go

557
00:31:06.247 --> 00:31:09.049
[Embarrassed laughter]
(Juyeon) But my appointment was just canceled.

558
00:31:09.116 --> 00:31:10.750
Is it okay if we sit together?

559
00:31:11.717 --> 00:31:12.685
[Head shaking sound effect]

560
00:31:13.221 --> 00:31:14.955
Well, this is a family dinner.

561
00:31:15.022 --> 00:31:17.892
(Juyeon) Yongseong is one family
Wouldn't it matter?

562
00:31:17.959 --> 00:31:19.333
Still, Team Leader Baek

563
00:31:19.400 --> 00:31:21.066
I've done something great recently

564
00:31:21.133 --> 00:31:23.433
I wanted to treat you to a meal.

565
00:31:23.500 --> 00:31:25.064
Oh, really? Are we Sujeong?

566
00:31:25.707 --> 00:31:27.168
No, Subin’s girlfriend is coming.

567
00:31:27.235 --> 00:31:29.300
(Soobin) No, no, it’s okay, it’s okay

568
00:31:29.367 --> 00:31:31.770
We're not shy because we're hacks.

569
00:31:31.837 --> 00:31:32.999
[light laughter]

570
00:31:33.066 --> 00:31:34.166
(Juyeon) Let’s sit down and talk.

571
00:31:34.233 --> 00:31:37.033
What is this Baek Soo-jeong doing?
Where and how did you do it?

572
00:31:37.100 --> 00:31:38.882
I will tell you in great detail.

573
00:31:38.949 --> 00:31:41.482
Ah, yes, okay, yes
Sit down, yeah, yeah, yeah

574
00:31:41.549 --> 00:31:42.581
[Wonseop’s happy laughter]

575
00:31:44.819 --> 00:31:46.252
[Wonseop and Soobin’s laughter]

576
00:31:47.553 --> 00:31:49.467
(Juyeon) Thanks to team leader Baek Soo-jeong

577
00:31:49.534 --> 00:31:51.423
I was able to persuade CEO Ahn.

578
00:31:51.490 --> 00:31:53.325
(Wonseop) Ah, my child
I'm so persistent

579
00:31:53.392 --> 00:31:54.527
Uh, who does it look like?

580
00:31:55.296 --> 00:31:57.463
(Wonseop) Excellent
Doesn’t he look like his father?

581
00:31:58.609 --> 00:32:01.502
The general manager really cares about people.

582
00:32:01.569 --> 00:32:02.435
[Juyeon’s light smile]

583
00:32:02.956 --> 00:32:04.338
I'm kind of like that.
[cell phone vibrating sound]

584
00:32:04.405 --> 00:32:05.637
(Wonseop) [Laughing] Of course!

585
00:32:05.704 --> 00:32:06.707
[Wonseop’s laughter]

586
00:32:06.774 --> 00:32:08.275
(Soobin) Oh, what should I do?

587
00:32:08.342 --> 00:32:10.700
Yes, they said they might not be able to come after an emergency dispatch?

588
00:32:10.767 --> 00:32:11.966
Oh, really?

589
00:32:12.033 --> 00:32:13.099
There's nothing I can do, right?

590
00:32:13.166 --> 00:32:15.314
Oh, that girl is a police officer, police officer

591
00:32:15.381 --> 00:32:16.233
(Juyeon) Ah...

592
00:32:16.300 --> 00:32:17.433
(Subin) I’m so sorry

593
00:32:17.500 --> 00:32:19.966
Congratulations again on getting your dad’s cast off.

594
00:32:20.033 --> 00:32:21.322
He said he would buy it next time

595
00:32:21.389 --> 00:32:24.458
(Wonseop) Oh, just with that feeling
Say thank you so much

596
00:32:24.525 --> 00:32:26.166
Then, today, this place is

597
00:32:26.233 --> 00:32:27.700
I can serve it to you.

598
00:32:27.767 --> 00:32:29.163
Eat as much as you want

599
00:32:29.230 --> 00:32:30.898
[upbeat music]
Ah, who keeps doing whatever they want...

600
00:32:30.965 --> 00:32:31.897
(Juyeon) Here!

601
00:32:33.167 --> 00:32:35.134
I would like a menu, please.

602
00:32:40.107 --> 00:32:41.257
I ate well

603
00:32:45.580 --> 00:32:46.712
(Soobin) Hey, Ban Juyeon.

604
00:32:50.451 --> 00:32:52.852
Write, ah, no way, no way, I thought

605
00:32:53.400 --> 00:32:55.521
You are interested in my sister, right?

606
00:32:56.185 --> 00:32:58.834
[Meaningful music]
Dad said so?

607
00:32:58.901 --> 00:33:00.433
Yongseong's successor

608
00:33:00.500 --> 00:33:04.263
No, such a great person
Why did you do that to my sister?

609
00:33:05.233 --> 00:33:06.265
older sister

610
00:33:06.734 --> 00:33:10.600
I don't know what it's like over there, but
It's really precious to my family.

611
00:33:10.667 --> 00:33:13.366
I went through a lot of hardships and sacrificed a lot.

612
00:33:13.433 --> 00:33:14.706
If I get ignored,

613
00:33:14.773 --> 00:33:16.942
My sister was the one who even played games for me.

614
00:33:17.745 --> 00:33:20.146
If you're just joking around with a light heart

615
00:33:20.948 --> 00:33:22.784
I won't let you go.

616
00:33:27.955 --> 00:33:29.455
There's nothing to worry about

617
00:33:33.300 --> 00:33:36.028
Light hearted, no

618
00:33:41.469 --> 00:33:42.837
(Housekeeper) Chairman

619
00:33:42.904 --> 00:33:45.233
I have completed everything you instructed me to do.

620
00:33:45.300 --> 00:33:47.208
- (Hyoseon) Already?
- (Housekeeper) Yes.

621
00:33:47.275 --> 00:33:50.934
(Hyoseon) Anyway, he’s quick and thorough.

622
00:33:51.001 --> 00:33:54.380
Because I am like this
You also entrusted Director Ban’s house to me.

623
00:33:54.967 --> 00:33:56.582
Are you doing well there too?

624
00:33:58.168 --> 00:34:01.322
There's nothing else
He told me not to enter the study.

625
00:34:01.389 --> 00:34:03.190
(Housekeeper) You don’t need to clean.

626
00:34:03.257 --> 00:34:04.190
Study?

627
00:34:04.992 --> 00:34:06.325
What's there?

628
00:34:06.834 --> 00:34:08.329
I don't know

629
00:34:08.396 --> 00:34:10.763
It seemed like CCTV was also installed.

630
00:34:11.367 --> 00:34:13.367
[Meaningful music]

631
00:34:14.435 --> 00:34:15.868
Okay, let's go.

632
00:34:23.311 --> 00:34:24.412
[Call connection tone]

633
00:34:30.618 --> 00:34:31.851
(In-kyung) Did you call me, Chairman?

634
00:34:33.200 --> 00:34:34.553
(Hyoseon) Please go in first.

635
00:34:39.026 --> 00:34:40.392
As soon as the schedule is completed

636
00:34:41.062 --> 00:34:42.595
Let's go to Director Ban's house.

637
00:34:43.734 --> 00:34:45.032
What happened suddenly?

638
00:34:45.099 --> 00:34:46.665
(Hyo-seon) I need to take a look at the study.

639
00:34:47.802 --> 00:34:50.600
other people
They say they won't even let you go in.

640
00:34:50.667 --> 00:34:52.404
how important is it

641
00:34:53.174 --> 00:34:54.306
I'm curious

642
00:34:55.343 --> 00:34:56.767
I will contact the general manager.

643
00:34:56.834 --> 00:34:57.776
(Hyoseon) No

644
00:34:58.446 --> 00:34:59.424
That won't happen

645
00:35:11.567 --> 00:35:13.459
Where have your father and younger brother gone?

646
00:35:16.163 --> 00:35:18.063
I sent it first, I have something to tell you.

647
00:35:20.433 --> 00:35:21.800
What are you thinking?

648
00:35:22.867 --> 00:35:24.370
Why did you come all the way here?

649
00:35:25.606 --> 00:35:27.539
(Edited) Last time
Wasn't the story settled?

650
00:35:27.606 --> 00:35:28.641
I thought I understood

651
00:35:32.066 --> 00:35:33.212
I did it because I was scared.

652
00:35:34.248 --> 00:35:36.248
[Calm music]

653
00:35:38.166 --> 00:35:39.852
While I was acting like a fool

654
00:35:40.721 --> 00:35:42.821
If Baek Soo-jeong likes someone else

655
00:35:45.267 --> 00:35:46.132
What should I do?

656
00:35:46.625 --> 00:35:47.760
I don't like that

657
00:35:50.898 --> 00:35:52.097
(Juyeon) Just because I understand

658
00:35:54.368 --> 00:35:56.001
The heart doesn't disappear

659
00:36:02.001 --> 00:36:03.208
[cell phone vibrating sound]

660
00:36:13.585 --> 00:36:14.421
(Juyeon) Yes, manager.

661
00:36:14.488 --> 00:36:16.366
(In-kyung) Chairman
As soon as you finish your event visit schedule

662
00:36:16.433 --> 00:36:18.392
The director is visiting the house.

663
00:36:18.459 --> 00:36:20.133
The chairman is coming home?

664
00:36:20.200 --> 00:36:22.695
(In-kyung) Yes, we are leaving in two hours.

665
00:36:23.631 --> 00:36:25.032
In the director’s study

666
00:36:25.099 --> 00:36:28.367
[nervous music]
I think you think there's something there.

667
00:36:30.304 --> 00:36:31.337
[Juyeon’s embarrassed sigh]

668
00:36:36.660 --> 00:36:38.077
(Juyeon) I have to go home right now

669
00:36:38.946 --> 00:36:39.911
(Surrender) What's going on?

670
00:36:39.978 --> 00:36:41.482
Why is the Chairman coming to my house?

671
00:36:41.549 --> 00:36:42.917
Study

672
00:36:42.984 --> 00:36:44.416
You noticed, there

673
00:36:46.505 --> 00:36:48.129
(Sujeong) Oh, calm down for a moment.

674
00:36:48.196 --> 00:36:49.128
[sigh]

675
00:36:49.924 --> 00:36:51.292
[Sound of shaking iron door]
(Young lead character) Grandma just once, Grandma!

676
00:36:51.359 --> 00:36:52.825
Please look at grandma just once

677
00:36:53.394 --> 00:36:54.895
Grandma don't do that

678
00:36:54.962 --> 00:36:56.829
Grandma! grandma!

679
00:36:59.700 --> 00:37:01.667
It might all burn up and disappear.

680
00:37:04.036 --> 00:37:05.237
my precious things

681
00:37:08.276 --> 00:37:09.141
(Juyeon) Get out of the way

682
00:37:09.208 --> 00:37:10.578
(Edited) What if it continues like this?

683
00:37:10.645 --> 00:37:11.777
Are there any measures?

684
00:37:14.448 --> 00:37:15.547
[sigh]

685
00:37:16.584 --> 00:37:18.183
Let's take the time first.

686
00:37:26.060 --> 00:37:27.059
(Shinwon) Chairman!

687
00:37:28.380 --> 00:37:29.624
Oh, hello?

688
00:37:30.200 --> 00:37:31.934
You remember me, right? Identity

689
00:37:32.001 --> 00:37:33.334
Shinwon Kim

690
00:37:33.401 --> 00:37:34.367
Ah!

691
00:37:35.033 --> 00:37:36.235
It's been a while, dear.

692
00:37:36.904 --> 00:37:40.467
Even these days, with Director Ban
Are you saying we're close?

693
00:37:40.534 --> 00:37:41.934
Yes, of course

694
00:37:42.001 --> 00:37:43.809
We get along well like real brothers.

695
00:37:43.876 --> 00:37:45.944
As Jooyeon was assigned to the department store,

696
00:37:46.011 --> 00:37:47.579
We've been seeing each other more often lately.

697
00:37:48.166 --> 00:37:49.014
Yeah?

698
00:37:49.643 --> 00:37:50.651
Ah, but

699
00:37:50.718 --> 00:37:53.519
Ah, Chairman, then and now.
Nothing has changed

700
00:37:54.110 --> 00:37:56.233
Will time pass by only the Chairman?

701
00:37:56.300 --> 00:37:59.166
(Shinwon) Ah, the public relations department at the head office.
You need to reflect.

702
00:37:59.233 --> 00:38:01.233
Photos don't compare to the real thing.

703
00:38:01.300 --> 00:38:02.930
How are you so young and pretty?

704
00:38:02.997 --> 00:38:04.329
[laughter]

705
00:38:05.567 --> 00:38:08.302
Your good-natured nature hasn't changed, has it?

706
00:38:08.369 --> 00:38:09.568
(Shinwon) [Smiling] Thank you

707
00:38:10.071 --> 00:38:12.571
But what are you doing here?

708
00:38:13.138 --> 00:38:16.208
(Shinwon) Ah! Ah, yes
What's nearby, I was passing by

709
00:38:16.275 --> 00:38:18.166
Chairman, have you eaten?

710
00:38:18.233 --> 00:38:20.714
If you didn't do it, come with me
Would you like to eat?

711
00:38:20.781 --> 00:38:22.133
Unless it's an opportunity like this

712
00:38:22.200 --> 00:38:24.900
When will I meet the Chairman again?
Would you like to have the honor of eating a meal?

713
00:38:24.967 --> 00:38:26.218
Yeah, haha, yeah

714
00:38:26.854 --> 00:38:27.886
I'm sorry but

715
00:38:28.534 --> 00:38:29.788
I'm busy so this is it

716
00:38:30.892 --> 00:38:31.790
(Shinwon) Oh, Chairman.

717
00:38:32.527 --> 00:38:34.860
Then, have a cup of tea, at least a cup of tea

718
00:38:35.830 --> 00:38:37.896
Don't take any more of my time

719
00:38:38.833 --> 00:38:39.834
(Identity) Yes...

720
00:38:39.901 --> 00:38:42.167
Oh, come on in, yeah

721
00:38:43.971 --> 00:38:44.937
[sigh]

722
00:38:47.803 --> 00:38:49.608
[Call connection tone]

723
00:38:50.077 --> 00:38:51.100
Uh, uh

724
00:38:51.167 --> 00:38:54.446
Ah, I took my time, but
I think it’s impossible to even eat rice.

725
00:38:54.513 --> 00:38:56.048
Hey, what the hell is going on?

726
00:38:56.817 --> 00:38:59.952
(Administrator) Oh, if you leave your car here,
What about other cars?

727
00:39:00.567 --> 00:39:01.520
restroom?

728
00:39:02.523 --> 00:39:03.657
[Administrator sighs]

729
00:39:03.724 --> 00:39:05.691
If you don't come right away, will I report you to the police?

730
00:39:06.351 --> 00:39:08.229
There was a lot of time delay

731
00:39:08.296 --> 00:39:10.863
The schedule for the visit to the headquarters director’s home is:
Shall we postpone it until later?

732
00:39:11.667 --> 00:39:12.631
(Hyo-seon) It’s okay

733
00:39:13.701 --> 00:39:15.600
It only takes a moment anyway

734
00:39:15.667 --> 00:39:17.002
Do you have plans for the next time?

735
00:39:17.069 --> 00:39:18.637
Why do you talk so much?

736
00:39:20.239 --> 00:39:21.173
(In-kyung) I’m sorry

737
00:39:22.233 --> 00:39:23.375
[Sound of door opening]

738
00:39:23.911 --> 00:39:25.377
[Exciting music]

739
00:39:25.444 --> 00:39:26.812
[Sound of door closing]

740
00:39:26.879 --> 00:39:29.614
(Hajin) Oh, I’m sorry.
I'm in too much of a hurry

741
00:39:29.681 --> 00:39:31.516
But this is about one car

742
00:39:31.583 --> 00:39:34.253
I think it will pass by enough, but it's strange.

743
00:39:34.722 --> 00:39:37.934
(Manager) Park the car in the middle of nowhere
What are you talking about out loud?

744
00:39:38.001 --> 00:39:38.957
Is that so?

745
00:39:39.458 --> 00:39:41.360
But this is just, huh?

746
00:39:41.834 --> 00:39:43.631
(Hajin) I guess it’s not going to work out like this.

747
00:39:43.698 --> 00:39:45.966
(Administrator) Oh, that's enough.
Quick, quickly get out of the car.

748
00:39:46.033 --> 00:39:47.333
(Hajin) Yes, yes

749
00:39:47.400 --> 00:39:49.867
But I'm saying that because I'm so sorry.

750
00:39:49.934 --> 00:39:51.503
Would you like me to slice you a plate of raw fish?

751
00:39:52.740 --> 00:39:55.009
Just arrived from Jeju Island
It's full of dageumbari!

752
00:39:55.076 --> 00:39:55.941
(Administrator) Ah, you old man!

753
00:39:56.008 --> 00:39:58.043
Stop talking nonsense and get out of the car quickly!

754
00:39:58.980 --> 00:40:01.515
[Laughing sheepishly] I guess you don’t like it?

755
00:40:01.582 --> 00:40:03.115
(Hajin) I understand, yes

756
00:40:20.534 --> 00:40:21.902
Uh, Sujeong-ah

757
00:40:21.969 --> 00:40:23.502
Oh, I did my best

758
00:40:24.372 --> 00:40:26.371
But why are you telling me to tie the Chairman’s feet?

759
00:40:32.834 --> 00:40:34.834
[Sparkling sound effect]
[Calm music]

760
00:40:42.501 --> 00:40:44.501
[Twinkle sound effect]

761
00:40:53.100 --> 00:40:54.900
What are you telling me later?

762
00:40:56.761 --> 00:40:57.901
Uh, uh

763
00:40:57.968 --> 00:40:58.706
[Call end sound]

764
00:40:58.773 --> 00:41:00.405
Hello? hello?

765
00:41:02.166 --> 00:41:03.015
What is it

766
00:41:04.011 --> 00:41:04.854
Huh?

767
00:41:06.500 --> 00:41:08.180
[Shinwon’s light smile]
We all meet in a place like this?

768
00:41:11.054 --> 00:41:12.099
That's right

769
00:41:12.166 --> 00:41:13.252
What's going on here?

770
00:41:13.721 --> 00:41:16.166
Oh, I have a favor to ask from Sujeong.

771
00:41:16.233 --> 00:41:18.190
Huh? I received a request from Juyeon.

772
00:41:18.934 --> 00:41:20.099
(Hajin) Really?

773
00:41:20.166 --> 00:41:21.693
I thought you two had grown apart

774
00:41:22.333 --> 00:41:23.300
Isn't it?

775
00:41:23.367 --> 00:41:24.796
[bird chirping]

776
00:41:25.600 --> 00:41:27.016
Anyway, it was nice to meet you

777
00:41:27.083 --> 00:41:28.148
Then I'll leave

778
00:41:28.669 --> 00:41:29.637
Ah, yes
[Shameless sigh]

779
00:41:30.805 --> 00:41:31.906
take care

780
00:41:31.973 --> 00:41:33.238
(Hajin) Yes

781
00:41:33.305 --> 00:41:34.873
[Truck starting sound]

782
00:41:45.573 --> 00:41:47.152
If you're so happy

783
00:41:48.022 --> 00:41:49.187
Just get off for a moment

784
00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:06.471
[rustling sound]

785
00:42:11.712 --> 00:42:13.712
What should I do? I have to quickly load up the rest of my luggage.

786
00:42:14.348 --> 00:42:15.890
yes, you should

787
00:42:18.152 --> 00:42:19.284
[cell phone vibrating sound]

788
00:42:21.589 --> 00:42:23.033
(In-kyung)

789
00:42:23.100 --> 00:42:25.223
[nervous music]
You arrived in front of the house.

790
00:42:27.233 --> 00:42:28.300
Already?

791
00:42:28.367 --> 00:42:29.433
(Edit) Uh...

792
00:42:29.500 --> 00:42:31.765
First of all, have you moved all the important luggage?

793
00:42:31.832 --> 00:42:33.131
What should I do with the rest of this?

794
00:42:33.799 --> 00:42:35.133
If the entrance to this room is blocked...

795
00:42:35.200 --> 00:42:36.971
Anyway, since I doubted it once,

796
00:42:37.038 --> 00:42:38.773
You just won't go back

797
00:42:38.840 --> 00:42:39.938
What should I do then?

798
00:42:46.848 --> 00:42:48.613
[dark music]

799
00:42:51.714 --> 00:42:53.285
[Elevator arrival sound]

800
00:43:03.998 --> 00:43:06.999
(Hyo-seon) Director Ban
I came to see how you live.

801
00:43:07.635 --> 00:43:09.401
I guess it's the way out?

802
00:43:09.468 --> 00:43:10.435
yes

803
00:43:10.969 --> 00:43:13.267
If you don't mind
Next time I'll formally invite you...

804
00:43:13.334 --> 00:43:15.974
(Hyoseon) I’m taking a quick look at the house.
What kind of invitation?

805
00:43:16.808 --> 00:43:18.109
Why?

806
00:43:18.176 --> 00:43:20.712
When I go home
Is there any reason why not?

807
00:43:25.650 --> 00:43:26.651
no

808
00:43:27.486 --> 00:43:28.620
(Hyoseon) Unless it’s urgent

809
00:43:29.090 --> 00:43:30.255
Let’s go up together, right?

810
00:43:49.501 --> 00:43:50.776
Guide me to the study

811
00:43:51.943 --> 00:43:52.978
yes

812
00:44:10.131 --> 00:44:12.364
[nervous music]

813
00:44:26.180 --> 00:44:27.682
(Hyoseon) It looks ordinary

814
00:44:29.851 --> 00:44:32.751
Are you curious as to why they don’t even let you clean?

815
00:44:40.091 --> 00:44:44.665
What is hidden inside here?

816
00:44:46.734 --> 00:44:47.802
huh?

817
00:44:51.603 --> 00:44:52.971
[Meaningful sound effects]
[surprised gasp]

818
00:44:56.400 --> 00:44:57.609
[Meaningful sound effects]

819
00:45:10.725 --> 00:45:12.725
[heavy music]

820
00:45:16.264 --> 00:45:17.195
(Juyeon) I’m sorry

821
00:45:20.765 --> 00:45:22.300
(Edited) I’ll leave first.

822
00:45:22.367 --> 00:45:24.536
If you go out now and run into each other
You'll be in trouble

823
00:45:29.410 --> 00:45:30.375
It's here

824
00:45:36.400 --> 00:45:37.449
[sigh]

825
00:45:47.261 --> 00:45:49.728
I did another useless thing

826
00:45:50.562 --> 00:45:52.364
Were you trying to hide this?

827
00:45:54.569 --> 00:45:56.401
If I knew you had this picture

828
00:45:58.234 --> 00:45:59.404
Because you'll hate it

829
00:46:02.844 --> 00:46:04.145
I have no right to cry

830
00:46:06.845 --> 00:46:08.480
Because I don't have the right to be sad

831
00:46:10.315 --> 00:46:11.216
yes

832
00:46:12.183 --> 00:46:13.918
(Hyo-seon) Why did you do that when you knew that?

833
00:46:13.985 --> 00:46:14.953
Qualifications...

834
00:46:18.626 --> 00:46:19.794
I know there isn't one

835
00:46:21.462 --> 00:46:23.728
I wanted to keep at least one photo nearby.

836
00:46:29.070 --> 00:46:30.502
I miss you so much

837
00:46:32.440 --> 00:46:34.873
Do you know that you have the right to miss me?

838
00:46:35.343 --> 00:46:37.343
[Heavy Music - Continued]

839
00:46:40.648 --> 00:46:41.680
[Hyoseon’s light sigh]

840
00:46:43.384 --> 00:46:44.983
If it weren't for you

841
00:46:46.487 --> 00:46:48.954
my son would be here

842
00:46:52.924 --> 00:46:54.829
It's not an ordinary photo

843
00:46:54.896 --> 00:46:56.695
Really my son!

844
00:46:57.498 --> 00:46:58.496
[Sound of picture frame breaking]

845
00:47:17.385 --> 00:47:18.683
[sigh]

846
00:47:19.654 --> 00:47:20.852
weak thing

847
00:47:47.846 --> 00:47:50.815
(Hyosun) Let’s watch more closely from now on.

848
00:47:51.816 --> 00:47:53.084
Should we at least put surveillance on it?

849
00:47:54.501 --> 00:47:56.876
You are my watchdog.

850
00:47:56.943 --> 00:47:58.123
Who else are you naming?

851
00:47:59.409 --> 00:48:02.494
Ah, yes, I am more certain.
We'll watch

852
00:48:07.535 --> 00:48:08.933
[Car starting sound]

853
00:48:15.901 --> 00:48:17.175
[tire rubbing sound]

854
00:48:25.972 --> 00:48:27.452
[Sound of door opening]

855
00:48:31.392 --> 00:48:32.957
(Sujeong) Be careful, you’ll get hurt.

856
00:48:44.572 --> 00:48:47.072
My parents had a car accident
You know he passed away, right?

857
00:48:49.767 --> 00:48:51.042
[Sad music]

858
00:48:51.660 --> 00:48:53.878
(Juyeon) All together
I was on my way to a comic book event.

859
00:48:54.982 --> 00:48:56.281
Both of you were busy

860
00:48:58.586 --> 00:49:01.186
Because I begged and begged.
I want to go so bad

861
00:49:03.450 --> 00:49:04.923
Then there was an accident

862
00:49:07.361 --> 00:49:09.527
Thanks to my parents' protection, I survived

863
00:49:10.998 --> 00:49:14.199
The two of you had an accident you didn't have to face.
He died because of me.

864
00:49:16.464 --> 00:49:19.471
Because of me, my grandmother
Because it is true that I lost my only son.

865
00:49:21.576 --> 00:49:23.708
I decided to make it up to you

866
00:49:27.148 --> 00:49:30.048
Just like grandma wants
Let's take my father's place

867
00:49:33.020 --> 00:49:34.018
Director

868
00:49:43.543 --> 00:49:44.763
But even so

869
00:49:46.968 --> 00:49:48.633
I couldn't give up my joy

870
00:49:49.971 --> 00:49:52.137
(Main Role) The next volume of my favorite comic book

871
00:49:52.807 --> 00:49:54.873
The band's next song, next show

872
00:49:57.445 --> 00:49:58.943
There must be such things

873
00:50:01.482 --> 00:50:03.200
I could look forward to tomorrow

874
00:50:08.643 --> 00:50:10.591
Even if no one loves me

875
00:50:10.658 --> 00:50:12.190
Because it felt like it was filling up

876
00:50:13.300 --> 00:50:15.300
[Sad music-continued]

877
00:50:17.772 --> 00:50:18.830
So

878
00:50:21.797 --> 00:50:24.135
At that time, Baek Soo-jeong was in front of the fountain.

879
00:50:25.641 --> 00:50:28.706
things I like
When you tell me to like you more freely

880
00:50:33.047 --> 00:50:34.516
i really liked it

881
00:50:37.785 --> 00:50:39.150
I meant it.

882
00:50:41.088 --> 00:50:42.120
then

883
00:50:44.492 --> 00:50:46.424
Because he looked really happy

884
00:50:49.413 --> 00:50:52.263
I hope you continue to be happy

885
00:51:03.370 --> 00:51:04.375
I like it

886
00:51:08.998 --> 00:51:11.583
Things I've liked for a long time
I hid it

887
00:51:13.551 --> 00:51:16.190
(Juyeon) What I like
Because it was all a secret

888
00:51:16.257 --> 00:51:18.256
So I couldn't say it, but

889
00:51:23.598 --> 00:51:25.697
Now I really like Baek Soo-jeong

890
00:51:32.900 --> 00:51:34.465
I'm sorry, I couldn't hold back.

891
00:51:38.112 --> 00:51:39.210
I was thankful for today

892
00:51:53.728 --> 00:51:55.026
[Sound of automatic door opening]

893
00:52:00.935 --> 00:52:02.867
[Sound of automatic door closing]

894
00:52:08.072 --> 00:52:09.807
[bird chirping]

895
00:52:19.017 --> 00:52:20.251
[Door lock operating sound]

896
00:52:22.200 --> 00:52:23.124
[Sound of door closing]
[Door lock operating sound]

897
00:52:23.191 --> 00:52:24.125
(Wonseop) Is your daughter here?

898
00:52:24.192 --> 00:52:26.324
(Edited) Oh, uh, you were at your dad’s house?

899
00:52:26.391 --> 00:52:27.709
(Wonseop) What is he talking about?

900
00:52:27.776 --> 00:52:29.476
Are you asking me to take your luggage for you?

901
00:52:29.543 --> 00:52:31.462
People came and moved all their luggage and left.

902
00:52:32.142 --> 00:52:34.065
Oh, right, I did.

903
00:52:34.969 --> 00:52:36.137
Where does it hurt?

904
00:52:36.204 --> 00:52:38.102
I heard you were meeting someone, but why is your complexion like this?

905
00:52:38.639 --> 00:52:40.001
Uh, no, it hurts.

906
00:52:41.176 --> 00:52:43.976
Uh, that burden
I asked you to move it to your attic.

907
00:52:44.043 --> 00:52:45.810
Oh my, why do you have so much baggage?

908
00:52:47.073 --> 00:52:50.484
Someone I know left it to me for a while.
I'll take it back soon

909
00:52:50.551 --> 00:52:52.876
Uh, okay, well, I’m not using it anyway.

910
00:52:52.943 --> 00:52:55.153
(Wonseop) I don’t care if you leave it for a long time

911
00:52:56.443 --> 00:52:57.655
Is your daughter really okay?

912
00:52:58.810 --> 00:53:00.027
Ah, then

913
00:53:00.094 --> 00:53:01.793
What's wrong with me?

914
00:53:03.030 --> 00:53:04.082
[laughter]

915
00:53:05.967 --> 00:53:07.031
Sujeong-ah

916
00:53:07.682 --> 00:53:08.533
(Edited) Huh?

917
00:53:09.003 --> 00:53:10.134
That dad

918
00:53:11.539 --> 00:53:13.504
It hurts when you smile like that

919
00:53:14.557 --> 00:53:15.974
[Sentimental music]
(Wonseop) Because my dad can’t grow up

920
00:53:16.611 --> 00:53:18.776
Because I can't be a place for you to lean on

921
00:53:20.047 --> 00:53:22.080
No matter what happens, I can't speak

922
00:53:22.917 --> 00:53:25.419
I thought he was just laughing like this

923
00:53:25.486 --> 00:53:26.451
So...

924
00:53:27.843 --> 00:53:29.387
[Sighing] Dad

925
00:53:30.224 --> 00:53:32.590
(Sujeong) Don’t really worry, nothing’s going on.

926
00:53:33.294 --> 00:53:35.998
Just go far away and come back
I guess it's because I'm tired

927
00:53:37.832 --> 00:53:39.697
Oh, okay, then go in and get some rest.

928
00:53:41.135 --> 00:53:42.633
- Dad, go in quickly.
- (Wonseop) Oh

929
00:53:44.476 --> 00:53:45.570
[Sound of door opening]

930
00:53:47.813 --> 00:53:48.806
[Sound of door closing]

931
00:54:00.388 --> 00:54:01.698
(Juyeon) I’ve been smiling since a while ago

932
00:54:02.977 --> 00:54:04.222
Don’t you usually smile a lot?

933
00:54:05.059 --> 00:54:06.691
How do you feel better?

934
00:54:09.764 --> 00:54:11.629
Still, isn’t it a bit difficult to try hard alone?

935
00:54:12.879 --> 00:54:13.865
lonely and

936
00:54:27.181 --> 00:54:29.884
Things I've liked for a long time
I hid it

937
00:54:29.951 --> 00:54:32.283
Because everything I liked was a secret

938
00:54:32.753 --> 00:54:34.852
So I couldn't say it, but

939
00:54:36.657 --> 00:54:38.589
Now I really like Baek Soo-jeong

940
00:54:47.367 --> 00:54:49.267
[Music: ‘That Guy is the Black Flame Dragon’ OST]

941
00:54:51.767 --> 00:54:52.904
[Door lock operating sound]

942
00:54:54.672 --> 00:54:56.040
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

943
00:55:24.068 --> 00:55:25.873
(Juyeon) I know it’s crazy

944
00:55:26.747 --> 00:55:27.872
I remember everything

945
00:55:29.710 --> 00:55:30.708
That

946
00:55:32.815 --> 00:55:33.845
It was my first kiss

947
00:55:50.198 --> 00:55:52.198
[Music: ‘That Guy is the Black Flame Dragon’ OST-Continued]

948
00:55:54.635 --> 00:55:56.537
(Guide voice) Customer’s
My phone is off

949
00:55:56.604 --> 00:55:58.069
[Sujeong’s worried sigh]
To the sound source...

950
00:55:58.803 --> 00:56:01.405
[Heavy breathing]

951
00:56:02.908 --> 00:56:03.841
I like it

952
00:56:05.465 --> 00:56:07.278
[Heavy breathing]

953
00:56:13.543 --> 00:56:15.553
[Doorbell sounds]

954
00:56:15.620 --> 00:56:16.387
[Knocking on door]

955
00:56:16.454 --> 00:56:17.721
(Edited) Director

956
00:56:17.788 --> 00:56:18.626
[Knocking on door]

957
00:56:18.693 --> 00:56:19.991
Is the manager in there?

958
00:56:20.962 --> 00:56:22.860
I really want to ask you something.

959
00:56:25.733 --> 00:56:26.931
[Sigh of Sujeong]

960
00:57:21.634 --> 00:57:22.954
(Edited) You are here

961
00:57:26.894 --> 00:57:27.959
Baek Soo-jeong

962
00:57:29.564 --> 00:57:31.128
I have a question

963
00:57:32.798 --> 00:57:33.931
So I came

964
00:57:37.338 --> 00:57:38.402
(Edited) That day

965
00:57:39.073 --> 00:57:40.638
I remember kissing you

966
00:57:42.577 --> 00:57:44.408
Why did you run so far here?

967
00:57:46.614 --> 00:57:48.679
You knew it was crazy.

968
00:57:50.484 --> 00:57:52.516
If you come like that, what you've been hiding all this time

969
00:57:54.589 --> 00:57:56.320
Secrets that have been carefully kept

970
00:57:57.077 --> 00:57:59.757
Everything could be found out
You knew it

971
00:58:00.962 --> 00:58:02.193
But why did you come?

972
00:58:07.235 --> 00:58:09.937
Just because I like it

973
00:58:10.004 --> 00:58:11.202
For that one reason?

974
00:58:19.881 --> 00:58:20.978
Are you okay?

975
00:58:23.395 --> 00:58:25.516
We can be discovered at any time

976
00:58:26.512 --> 00:58:29.309
That's what the manager wants
To become Yongseong's successor

977
00:58:29.376 --> 00:58:30.588
It could be a problem

978
00:58:33.494 --> 00:58:34.558
I...

979
00:58:37.509 --> 00:58:39.163
Still, if only Baek Soo-jeong was there,

980
00:58:40.468 --> 00:58:41.799
I think everything will be okay

981
00:58:44.305 --> 00:58:45.937
If only Baek Soo-jeong liked me

982
00:58:58.419 --> 00:58:59.483
I understand

983
00:59:02.523 --> 00:59:03.454
(Edited) Then

984
00:59:07.094 --> 00:59:10.061
I will be the director’s biggest secret.

985
00:59:11.766 --> 00:59:13.998
I heard everything you like is a secret?

986
00:59:17.038 --> 00:59:19.470
It means that I like you too, Chief.

987
00:59:21.267 --> 00:59:23.010
[bright music]

988
00:59:23.077 --> 00:59:24.075
[surprised gasp]

989
01:00:16.990 --> 01:00:18.095
[Sound of lights turning on]

990
01:00:20.652 --> 01:00:22.233
[Sound of fountain coming]

991
01:00:26.807 --> 01:00:28.807
[Bright Music - Continued]

992
01:01:25.267 --> 01:01:27.540
[Meaningful sound effects]
[nervous music]

993
01:01:43.147 --> 01:01:45.382
[Music: ‘That Guy is the Black Flame Dragon’ OST]

994
01:02:14.543 --> 01:02:17.147
{\an8}(Edited) At the company
You know you really have to be more careful, right?

995
01:02:17.214 --> 01:02:19.587
{\an8}(Juyeon) Because you won’t get caught
don't worry

996
01:02:19.654 --> 01:02:21.822
{\an8}(Nana) You said that dating within a company is hell.

997
01:02:21.889 --> 01:02:23.042
{\an8}Internal Hell

998
01:02:23.109 --> 01:02:24.291
{\an8}(Edit) Go and pay

999
01:02:24.358 --> 01:02:27.257
{\an8}(Main role) Baek Soo-jeong
You're too resistant to improvisation.

1000
01:02:27.324 --> 01:02:29.309
{\an8}How do you feel better?

1001
01:02:29.376 --> 01:02:30.576
{\an8}(Shinwon) Are you really dating?

1002
01:02:30.643 --> 01:02:32.829
{\an8}[Juyeon’s laughter]
(Juyeon) Don’t try to know too deeply

1003
01:02:32.896 --> 01:02:33.734
{\an8}I got hurt

1004
01:02:33.801 --> 01:02:38.105
{\an8}(Shinwon) Juyeon
It’s been a while since you look truly happy.

1005
01:02:38.172 --> 01:02:40.437
{\an8}(Hajin) What if we find out who each other is?

